<title>INDIA: TISCO sees production up three pct in 97/98.</title>
<headline>TISCO sees production up three pct in 97/98.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Tata Iron and Steel Company Ltd. (TISCO) said on Thursday it expected its production volume to rise three percent during the financial year 1997/98 (April-March).</p>
</text>
